| `emailQueue` | Send emails | Normal | 5 | 3x exponential |
| `notificationQueue` | Push notifications | High | 10 | 5x exponential |
| `inventoryQueue` | Stock sync | Normal | 3 | 2x fixed |
| `paymentQueue` | Payment processing | Critical | 3 | 5x exponential |
| `webhookQueue` | Third-party webhooks | Normal | 5 | 3x exponential |
| `auditQueue` | Audit logs | Low | 2 | 1x |
| `imageQueue` | Image processing | Low | 2 | 2x fixed |
| `archivalQueue` | Data archival | Low | 1 | 1x |

**Background Cron Jobs:**

| Job | Schedule | Purpose |
|-----|----------|---------|
